  "title": "Neither Fox Nor Wolf: The Maned Wolf",
  "description": "The maned wolf is neither a fox nor a wolf. It is South America's largest canine and the tallest wild canid, standing up to 110 cm at the shoulder, with ears 18 cm long and an erectile black mane. It eats both meat and fruit and helps spread the seeds of the wolf apple."
 },
